        <div class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/70 p-4 text-xs text-amber-900 text-left max-w-2xl">
          <p class="font-bold mb-1">⚠️ 警惕网传“免费订阅”的安全陷阱：</p>
