            不花冤枉钱：如何安全利用正规商家的测试机制，满足轻度科研与备用需求：
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {trialTypes.map((item) => (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-dark/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
